      <h2>High Zinc-Content Dross for Recovery and Recycling</h2>
      <p>Zinc Dross is a zinc-rich by-product generated during hot-dip galvanizing, where small amounts of iron from the steel substrate react with molten zinc to form intermetallic compounds that sink to the bottom of the galvanizing bath. With 85–95% zinc content, Zinc Dross is a high-value secondary zinc material.</p>
      <p>Bhatti Chemicals Industry supplies high-grade Zinc Dross with consistent zinc content, making it a reliable feedstock for zinc smelters, refineries, and secondary zinc producers. Full laboratory analysis is available with every batch, and the product is supplied with proper documentation.</p>
